{"parse": {"title": "LEE-03", "pageid": 88300, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-02\" title=\"LEE-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LEE-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-04\" title=\"LEE-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LEE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AF.86.E7.A0.81.E5.AD.A6.E5.85.A5.E9.97.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"密码学入门\">密码学入门</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 密码学入门</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Cryptography for Beginners</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>船<span class=\"color-value\"></span>长<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>经<span class=\"color-value\"></span>历<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>数<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>挫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>折<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2410103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>玻璃壁凑近又拉远，连带着其中的磁流体波浪似地涌动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>像是在窥视某种隐秘的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>星锑研究员，你的意思是，你在参加一艘豪华游轮的宣传派对后收到了这份传单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不，不止一份！是整整一沓——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>好的，你的诉求我已经完全知悉了，星锑研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我重新整理一遍：</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>星锑研究员在游轮宣传活动中遭受了极其不公的对待，因此产生了严重的心理负担。为走出心理阴影，以免对后续的工作造成不利的影响，特此申请——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>提前预支接下来一年的工资，以及十五个自然日的特批假期，这一支出绝不会用于私人开支，仅作为短期游轮度假的散心活动！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>事实就是这样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>缸中的磁流体停滞了许久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>咳，星锑研究员，放下你手中的人工泪滴！我们暂时还用不上这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>组长——我就知道你一定会答应我的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你误会了，我可从来都没打算答应你的任何申请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>为什么？难道我不是科算中心的一份子吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>荒唐——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>星锑研究员，入职十一个月以来，你从未参加过任何一次科算中心的考核评定，也没有在正式的项目中发表任何可视化的成果！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>换而言之，你还没有通过拉普拉斯科算中心的试用期考核，自然也无法享有拉普拉斯正式员工的福利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>更何况，你还错过了“暴雨”专项研究小组的登记注册手续！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>累累罪证不容置辩地挤在了这个不大的办公室里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我、我反对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>抗议的声音显著地衰弱了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>反对无效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……星锑研究员，你打算参加“暴雨”专项研究小组的补录考核吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你的成绩将作为正式评估结果录入拉普拉斯的数据库，它将直接影响到你的正式评级。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——我愿意！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>收起你的慷慨激昂，星锑研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这只是一场简单的考核，不是去战场上送死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>组长熟练地打开书柜，它似乎对事态的发展早有预料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>一沓沓比传单分量更重的资料堂而皇之地挡住了星锑的全部视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>等等——这就是你说的简单的工作考核？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>噢，别紧张，这些只是你可能会用到的参考资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>它才是你需要面对的考核。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这些并不是毫无规律的随机数，它们其中有着相当完整的推导逻辑与思考路径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>计算机在你的左侧，第二个柜子里还有几本你可能会用到的参考资料，其中涉及了一部分计算机的基本原理及使用教程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>考虑到解密本身的难度系数较高，本次考核不设时间限制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>祝你好运，星锑研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>组长推门而去，徒留房间里一位受刑的囚徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>乌尔里希，你的行为和那些恶劣的水手有什么区别——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>他们至少不打算用可恶的数学来摧毁我的灵魂！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>救救我，布莱恩·梅、吉姆·莫里森、弗兰克·扎帕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>时间过去了多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>至少对于星锑而言，这一概念显得太过陌生而冷酷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>无数的数字在她的眼前跳舞、打转，字符模糊了视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>在浩如烟海的参考文献与典籍里，那可恶的数字谜题将她包围其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">这只是一场简单的考核，不是去战场上送死。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">……船长，APPLe某对此似乎有些印象。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:180%\">嗯……因为你是无理数，才会被盯上的吧。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:125%\">所以这是不可能的谜题吗？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">你在害怕吗？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:208%\">船长——！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">快跟上来，星锑。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:194%\">祝你好运，星锑研究员。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我是谁……？我在哪儿……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>恍惚间，她似乎领悟了某种真谛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这个世界一定是来自阿派朗学派的一场巨大阴谋——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>眼前的景象重新清晰了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>是的，它们不过是一个又一个的数学恶魔罢了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>救命啊——！</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>船<span class=\"color-value\"></span>长<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>经<span class=\"color-value\"></span>历<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>数<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>挫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>折<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2410103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>单方面的数字霸凌似乎远远没有尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>毫不知情的组长推门而入，它接过那张涂成一团乱麻的稿纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>看起来你的精神状态还不错，星锑研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>但很遗憾，这可不是什么数独游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>什……么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>可怜的船长如遭雷击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你太悲观了，星锑研究员——打起精神来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>第九次“暴雨”已经过去了，我们现在有充分的时间学习数学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>组长从纷纷扬扬落下的纸质雨幕中穿行而过，随手接下了其中一张凌乱的稿纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>在这里，我们只需要将这些信息编码进行最基本的解码，再代入拉普拉斯的密钥进行重编译……注意它们尾部第四位数字的变化，星锑研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>第十七区间的数字，没有任何一个数字大于24，而第十八区间的数字限度则是59……因此，我们便能做出一个大胆的假设——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这些代码很可能隶属于拉普拉斯命名法，这一规则要求将第十二区至第十八区用作可转译的时间编码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>它们被广泛运用于科算中心相关的船只编号、天文事业、人员批次等资料收录中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>将这些转译后的编码输入到拉普拉斯的天文数据库后，我得到了它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>一组天文照片。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_zhaopianqiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_zhaopianqiang\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_zhaopianqiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-2_4_at_zhaopianqiang.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_zhaopianqiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-2_4_at_zhaopianqiang.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_zhaopianqiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/Cg-2_4_at_zhaopianqiang.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_zhaopianqiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你的意思是，困扰我这么久的，只是几张普通的照片——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>星锑研究员，它们也许比你意识到的更重要一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>第一张拍摄于1995年12月2日，内容为太阳与日球层探测器的发射升空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>像是打开了灵感的缺口，源源不断的信息激烈而迅速地涌入了星锑的大脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>根据上面的数据显示，第二张照片拍摄于1997年6月25日，具体内容为太阳黑子的活动记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>而第三张照片拍摄于1998年11月21日，内容为太空拍摄，空间站的第一个舱体，一颗人造卫星。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>第四张是在1999年12月28日，拍下来的是一场……橄榄球赛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-515613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-515613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-515613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>那是在墨尔本举办的最后一场球赛，自那之后，那个体育场就被推平了，现在大概被归入了某类千篇一律的商业区划中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>她的视线继续向后，却又突兀地卡在了下一张照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不、不，这不对——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>如果按照你的说法，那么后面的照片根本无法解释……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>她的声线有些颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>是的，从第五张照片开始，我们已经无法确认具体的拍摄内容，它们可能涉及哈雷彗星、柯伊伯带阋神星、乌卢鲁运动会、摇滚音乐节等一系列内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>更可怕的是，它们的时间仍在向前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>2001年2月9日，2003年10月21日，2005年11月……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>最后一张是……2007年4月16日。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>组长抬起头来，窗外万里无云，巨大的信息流在其中悄无声息地奔涌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这证明了一件事。在我们，在基金会，在所有人未曾理解即将面临的浩劫，在第一次“暴雨”到来之时——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>有一位先驱，他穿越了“暴雨”，为我们留下了这些宝贵的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>“暴雨”，一个沉重的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>它又一次突兀地在人们的眼前显现，漫不经心地作弄着每一个试图理解这个荒唐世界的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>可……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>好在永远有人不会接受它的摆布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你为什么要告诉我这些？难道其他拉普拉斯员工的考核，都涉及这么重要的机密内容吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……我只是希望预支一部分工资而已啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>组长极力压抑住隐隐作痛的磁流体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>星锑，你明白么，一项伟大的事业正在我们面前展开——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>——难道你只能想到这个？！</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LEE-03"}}